; equality_sample_register: EQUALITY on a sample register raises TypeMismatch.
;
; spec/xqvm/SPEC.md's Faults table: a model-only opcode applied to a sample
; register raises TypeMismatch. EQUALITY writes QUBO terms, so it is
; model-only. Its charge is paid first and the default budget covers it, so
; the type check decides.

PUSH 4
BSMX r0          ; a binary sample, not a model
VECI r1
PUSH 0
VECPUSH r1
PUSH 1
VECPUSH r1       ; indices = [0, 1]
VECI r2
PUSH 1
VECPUSH r2
PUSH 1
VECPUSH r2       ; coeffs = [1, 1]
PUSH 1
PUSH 1           ; target, penalty
EQUALITY r0 r1 r2
HALT
